  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image juxtaposes a somber aerial view of the World Trade Center with text that trivializes the 9/11 victims by comparing their deaths to a 'reading speed' of 87 stories in 10 seconds. This is a deeply insensitive and harmful meme that reduces the profound human tragedy of 9/11 to a grotesque, dehumanizing joke. The intent is to shock or provoke through dark humor, but it causes significant emotional harm by mocking the victims and their suffering. The meme does not target a specific protected group with hate, but its content is profoundly disrespectful and offensive to the memory of those who died, making it harmful to society and the collective trauma associated with the event.",
